{"n": 505, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "505.webp", "text": "31-5a\n\n3111001 REPLACING FRONT AXLE\nCARRIER\n— Four Wheel Drive -\n\nRemove splash guard - see Group 51.\nRemove front wheels - see Group 36.\nRemove alr cleaner - see Group 13.\nDraw off hydraulic fluid in tank.\n\ninstallation:\n\nCheck front wheel alignment after in-\nstallation - see Group 32.\n\nBleed power steering - see Group 32.\n\nAttach Special Too! 00 0 200 on engine,\n\nSupports bear on bolts of side walls.\n\nUnserew left and right engine mounts.\n\ninstalation:\nTightening torque’.\n\nUnscrew hydraulic fluid pipes.\nPlug openings.\ninstallation:\n\nReplace gaskets.\nTightening torque*.\n\n* See Specitications of Gr. 31 and 32\n\nLoosen bolt (1).\nRemove bolt (2) and pull steering\nspindle off steering gear.\n\nInstallation:\nSlot of steering spindle faces mark of\n\ncap.\nBolt (2) must be In locking groove of\nSteering shaft.\n\nReplace self-locking nuts.\nTightening torque’.\n\nUnscrew lett and right nuts and pry off\ntle rods with Special Tool 32 2 070.\n\nInstallation\n\nBore and pin tree of grease.\nReplace self-locking nuts.\nTightening torque*.\n\nCautont\nDon't turn power steering as far as\nstop — radial oll seal would be damaged\n\nUnscrew left and right nuts and pry off\ncontro! arms with Special Tool\n31 2 160.\n\nInstallapon:\n\nBore and pin free of grease.\nTightening torque’,\n\nLock nuts with cotter pins.\n\nUnscrew brackets for left and right\ncontrol arms.\n\nInstallation:\nTightening torque\".\n\n* See Specifications of Gr. 31 and 32", "words": [["31-5a", 0.4602, 0.031, 0.5207, 0.0541], ["3111001", 0.2651, 0.0844, 0.314, 0.0963], ["REPLACING", 0.3231, 0.0844, 0.3871, 0.095], ["FRONT", 0.3911, 0.0844, 0.4284, 0.095], ["AXLE", 0.4335, 0.0831, 0.4612, 0.0937], ["CARRIER", 0.3231, 0.1003, 0.373, 0.1121], ["—", 0.3231, 0.1227, 0.3281, 0.1253], ["Four", 0.3322, 0.1161, 0.3564, 0.128], ["Wheel", 0.3604, 0.1174, 0.3921, 0.128], ["Drive", 0.3972, 0.1174, 0.4234, 0.128], ["-", 0.427